      "side": 1,
      "message": "Please take a look, thanks!\n\nInstead of one-time setting GUID during texture creation, I change it to a Dawn Native API that can set and reset the owner GUID any time during the textures\u0027 lifecycle. In this way, we can properly set the ownership information for textures that get reused from Graphite\u0027s resource provider cache. Also, I think with native API we can always assumes we are under Native Dawn without guarding behind `feature::DawnNative`.",
      "revId": "86ccc5045d3f290cc4fcd2e0bd36b199a3412a24",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
