      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-01-05T19:37:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "nit. Would it make sense to use 0 as a sentinel value to represent no owner or something instead? That way we don\u0027t need the struct and we could just pass the guid as the argument directly?",
