      "writtenOn": "2026-01-06T11:30:15Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I am not sure, if I get it right this `uint64_t` GUID comes from a hash function ([1]) that SHA1Diagest the name string, *theoretically* it might be zero although it would never actually happen. If we can live with that, I would remove this descriptor.\n\n[1]: https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:base/trace_event/memory_allocator_dump_guid.cc;drc\u003d56535b80c32d3a618b8fc8cfd7b1afdd3862e1b2;l\u003d16",
      "parentUuid": "6f2cdb07_50a8a9f6",
      "range": {
