      "message": "Chrome memory dumps already consider 0 to be an empty GUID [here](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:base/trace_event/memory_allocator_dump_guid.h;l\u003d31;drc\u003d5f5478c22e63ec0a3effbdc82c9fac2615690334) so you should be fine to use that as sentinel value in dawn too.",
